# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Vite copies public/ into dist/, so this ships with
# the build. GitHub Pages could not do this at all — it is one of the two reasons the site
# moved to Pages (the other is _redirects).

# The tool pages load wasm-vips, which spawns pthreads and so needs SharedArrayBuffer,
# which requires cross-origin isolation. Scoped to the tool routes rather than sitewide:
# COEP also constrains cross-origin subresources, and the rest of the site pulls Google
# Fonts (src/index.css) and fetches privacy policies from raw.githubusercontent.com
# (AppPrivacy.jsx) — neither needs isolation.
#
# NOTE: /:lang/tools/* is a placeholder segment, NOT /*/tools/*. Cloudflare Pages only
# honours a splat at the END of a path, so a middle splat silently matches nothing.
/:lang/tools/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

# The WASM and worker payloads need these on their OWN responses, not just on the pages
# that consume them. emscripten spawns its pthread pool by loading vips.js as a worker
# script, and in a cross-origin-isolated document that load is refused with
# ERR_BLOCKED_BY_RESPONSE unless the script response carries the isolation headers plus
# ACAO. When it is refused, vips never finishes initialising and the tools sit at 0%
# while the .wasm files load fine — it reads as a stall, not a header problem.
#
# This set is copied from lokaltools.com, which serves the same wasm-vips build and is
# known to work (verified 2026-09-10: vips init 2.5s there vs never on bibliofuse with
# COEP alone). Do not trim it without re-testing an actual conversion on the deployed
# site — the local dev server sets COEP on every response, so none of this reproduces
# before deploying.
#
# Also: do NOT add Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy here. It blocks the same worker load.
/wasm/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/workers/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
